Command completed successfully

2. Generating search queries...
Running: python -m ScholarEval.soundness.make_queries --research_plan <project>/ScholarEval-results/ai_13/soundness/research_plan.txt --methods_file <project>/ScholarEval-results/ai_13/soundness/methods.json --output_file <project>/ScholarEval-results/ai_13/soundness/queries.json --llm_engine_name qwen/qwen3.8-27b --cost_log_file <project>/ScholarEval-results/ai_13/soundness/soundness_costs.jsonl
Command completed successfully

3. Searching for relevant literature...
